        },
        {
          "id": "method-outer-heading",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 79.6875,
          "y": 233.7188,
          "width": 273.0469,
          "height": 31.7438,
          "text": "Improve the harness. ",
          "font_family": "Arial",
          "font_size": 26.25,
          "font_weight": 700,
          "font_style": "normal",
          "color": "#080c10",
          "align": "left",
          "line_height": 1.12,
          "source_ids": [
            "text-p006-032",
            "text-p006-030",
            "text-p006-020",
            "text-p007-032"
          ],
          "typography_role": "body",
          "near_background": "#ffffff"
        },
        {
          "id": "method-outer-first",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 352.7344,
          "y": 233.7188,
          "width": 383.2031,
          "height": 31.7438,
          "text": "Training tasks produce artifacts,",
          "font_family": "Arial",
          "font_size": 26.25,
          "font_weight": 400,
          "font_style": "normal",
          "color": "#080c10",
          "align": "left",
          "line_height": 1.12,
          "source_ids": [
            "text-p006-032",
            "text-p006-030",
            "text-p006-020",
            "text-p007-032"
          ],
          "typography_role": "body",
          "near_background": "#ffffff"
        },
        {
          "id": "method-outer-body",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 79.6875,
          "y": 263.1187,
          "width": 656.25,
          "height": 296.3438,
          "text": "trajectories and quality scores. The optimizer reads this evidence and the persistent history, identifies recurrent failures, proposes a plan and edits exactly one harness component. Its five options are context and memory, tools and specifications, execution runtime, orchestration, or evaluation and feedback. The evaluator is initialized from human-annotated references and stays fixed during autonomous optimization. Revising it requires explicit human guidance.",
